{"screen_name": "eno_1611", "file": "eno_1611", "name": "SiNoe", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1837127038110670848/zdRCywhj.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/857238768683581441/1742062545/1500x500", "description": "Illustrator / Live2D Artist & Rigger\nご依頼募集しております。\n・skeb〘http://skeb.jp/@eno_1611〙\n・お仕事のご依頼〘sinoework@gmail.com〙", "total_works": 5, "scraped_works": 5, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T11:02:43.309682+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T11:02:43.309682+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 30000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T11:02:43.309682+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 30000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 30000, "max": 30000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/eno_1611", "name": "eno_1611"}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/6085311", "name": "6085311"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@eno_1611/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb1cc986/uploads/origins/1c2ea34a-3bc4-4724-8c34-6b5d911ff4b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54cffe123d145ee0983ea8f78e0f5ffd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cb1cc986/uploads/origins/1c2ea34a-3bc4-4724-8c34-6b5d911ff4b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54cffe123d145ee0983ea8f78e0f5ffd, https://si.imgix.net/cb1cc986/uploads/origins/1c2ea34a-3bc4-4724-8c34-6b5d911ff4b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd9a1a0edcd36e4afe4b73ee3f72ba98 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cb1cc986/uploads/origins/1c2ea34a-3bc4-4724-8c34-6b5d911ff4b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=691c84b7e2d8d51a98fccd25da622df3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "만나서 반갑습니다. 귀여운 소녀를 깔끔하게 그려지기 때문에 의뢰하고 싶습니다 테두리 브레이크에 등장하는 쿠 랄차의 일러스트를 부탁드립니다. 은발로 좌우에 한방씩 빨간 메쉬가 들어있는 자칭 에스퍼 소녀입니다. 빨간 메쉬는 철쭉이 아니라 도중에 자라는 것 같습니다. 구도 등은 맡깁니다. 사용 용도는 Twitter에서 기뻐하거나 벽지로 해 기뻐합니다. PC라도 스마트폰이라도 벽지로 하기 때문에 세로로도 가로로도 괜찮습니다. 잘 부탁드립니다.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@eno_1611/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7a48940c/uploads/origins/234bf27f-2dc8-41fc-a05d-9a4361bf8f54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b4c0b9bf2315087fb7698dbcca9d2311", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7a48940c/uploads/origins/234bf27f-2dc8-41fc-a05d-9a4361bf8f54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b4c0b9bf2315087fb7698dbcca9d2311, https://si.imgix.net/7a48940c/uploads/origins/234bf27f-2dc8-41fc-a05d-9a4361bf8f54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=589f6cd10e9ce86dc141a6557fb05c86 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7a48940c/uploads/origins/234bf27f-2dc8-41fc-a05d-9a4361bf8f54?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0085cd8f1830dc47c321317ac8ef48ef 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@eno_1611/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/350f6518/uploads/origins/c7f664f1-69e3-4002-9024-bf47263c016e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eafaecda36fe98e743db98736865dab2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/350f6518/uploads/origins/c7f664f1-69e3-4002-9024-bf47263c016e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eafaecda36fe98e743db98736865dab2, https://si.imgix.net/350f6518/uploads/origins/c7f664f1-69e3-4002-9024-bf47263c016e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff69e3f0a5cf34e63233d39a5625cfa7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/350f6518/uploads/origins/c7f664f1-69e3-4002-9024-bf47263c016e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=756ea44a87c65362aa6e7e48e58ae203 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして！\nドルフロのP90ちゃんを好きなように描いていただけませんか？\n服は公式の服装でも、他の服飾でも構いません。\n構図などはお任せします。\n\n描きたいシチュが特になかったら下にいくつかのアイデアがあります。\nもちろん使わなくても大丈夫です。\n①P90ちゃんはデフォルトスキンを着て、左足のポーチを締めています。\nジャケットや装備を着てもボディースーツだけ着ても他の服装の状態でも大丈夫です。\n②P90ちゃんはバカ騒ぎして、鼻先にサングラスをかけています。\n変な顔をしています。\n③P90ちゃんはチャイナドレスを着て、見せつけます。\n上からの視点はいいかもしれません。\n\nよろしくお願いします。\n\nキャラについて\nhttps://wikiwiki.jp/dolls-fl/P90#f08b27f6\n\n立ち絵\nhttps://iopwiki.com/wiki/P90#Gallery\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/w/P90\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/images/1/1f/Pic_P90_HD.png\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/images/b/bc/Pic_P90_D_HD.png\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/images/3/37/Pic_P90_2802_HD.png\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/images/c/cb/Pic_P90_2802_D_HD.png\nhttps://iopwiki.com/images/c/cb/P90_costume2.png\nhttps://iopwiki.com/images/7/76/P90_costume2_D.png\n\nセリフ\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/w/P90/语音", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@eno_1611/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/86d9f924/uploads/origins/c725cba7-41fb-4913-b63f-f06e1311672b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7485c31b67b305c05409bc7709a389e8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/86d9f924/uploads/origins/c725cba7-41fb-4913-b63f-f06e1311672b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7485c31b67b305c05409bc7709a389e8, https://si.imgix.net/86d9f924/uploads/origins/c725cba7-41fb-4913-b63f-f06e1311672b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7ad35409a564cdf7a7a911c1f806b52 2x, https://si.imgix.net/86d9f924/uploads/origins/c725cba7-41fb-4913-b63f-f06e1311672b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=026425b33b235ea43ac0875e5371e592 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "안녕하세요. 만나서 반갑습니다. skeb 개방되어 있었으므로 의뢰시키고 받고 싶습니다. 유희왕 OCG 이빌 트윈의 두 사람을 신규 그림(자료 참고)로 그려 주었으면 합니다. 「마계로부터 온(이라고 하는 설정의) 대인기 가상 라이버\"Live☆Twin\"」라고 하는 표방의 얼굴로 활동하면서, 임무를 받으면 괴도로서 훔치기를 일한다고 하는 설정입니다. 포징 등은 맡겨주세요. 아이콘으로 사용시키고 싶습니다만 파일 형식을 두 사람 함께, 키스킬, 리라와 나눈 형식으로 부탁하고 싶습니다.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/yu_gi_oh_jp/status/1629813531129569281?s=20", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@eno_1611/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/40b932bc/uploads/origins/65140427-1430-4f7e-be33-6ae2fe02384c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a39f8504d66860f87ee5c06ac333c09", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/40b932bc/uploads/origins/65140427-1430-4f7e-be33-6ae2fe02384c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a39f8504d66860f87ee5c06ac333c09, https://si.imgix.net/40b932bc/uploads/origins/65140427-1430-4f7e-be33-6ae2fe02384c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9c73604d739c02640cca9a8b5bf2c3b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/40b932bc/uploads/origins/65140427-1430-4f7e-be33-6ae2fe02384c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=833d7816ae5411410822d165cf0349dc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして、\n素敵な作品をいつも拝見させていただいてます、\n是非とも私のゲーム内のキャラクターを描いて頂きたくご依頼させて頂きました。\n\n服は複数準備しましたので、描きたい方を選んでください！\n構図やポーズはお任せします、自由に描いてください。\n\n可能でありましたらイラストは 4800x2700 、もしくは 3840x2160 でお願いします。（16：9）\n\n参考資料：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ixmwEZxPMjllePI8XCkdCFfFIwGSQHKr\n\nお忙しいところ恐縮ですが、ご検討のほど宜しくお願い申し上げます。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ixmwEZxPMjllePI8XCkdCFfFIwGSQHKr", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}